+// 5985426719, Opus 5985519108).
+//
+// Before: only open and uncollectible invoices were read and voided. A renewal
+// draft finalized and paid 4,900 after the reads, the captured open invoice was
+// voided, the DELETE went out, the row recorded cancelled with no alert, and
+// the client had paid with no plan.
+// Now: a complete draft page is read first. Stripe never deletes a
+// subscription's draft, so each draft is finalized with auto_advance=false
+// (confirmed open, no payment attempt) and voided (confirmed void) before the
+// other voids, each call on a renewed lease. Before the DELETE the draft, open,
+// uncollectible and paid pages are read again: a payment supersedes (paid plan
+// kept, billed alert); a new invoice or an unknown page retries; no DELETE.
+//
+// Every test below except the controls fails on #707 ffed434e and passes after.
+// Real TrialConflictService + real StripeConnectApiService over an intercepted
+// fetch; in-memory compare-and-set table.
